# Loge: SMT-LIB smoke test

```elixir
root = Path.expand("..", __DIR__)

Mix.install([
  {:loge, path: Path.join(root, "loge"), override: true},
  {:loge_smtlib, path: Path.join(root, "loge_smtlib")},
  {:kino_loge, path: Path.join(root, "kino_loge")}
])
```

z3 and cvc5 are not bundled: put them on `PATH`, or set their executables in a
**Logic Engine Settings** cell.

## Solving

Expected: **Satisfiable**, a model with `x` and `y` summing to 10.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ6MyIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoic210bGliIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInNvdXJjZSI6IihzZXQtbG9naWMgUUZfTElBKVxuKGRlY2xhcmUtY29uc3QgeCBJbnQpXG4oZGVjbGFyZS1jb25zdCB5IEludClcbihhc3NlcnQgKD4geCAyKSlcbihhc3NlcnQgKD0gKCsgeCB5KSAxMCkpXG4oY2hlY2stc2F0KVxuKGdldC1tb2RlbClcbiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Z3,
  "(set-logic QF_LIA)\n(declare-const x Int)\n(declare-const y Int)\n(assert (> x 2))\n(assert (= (+ x y) 10))\n(check-sat)\n(get-model)\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

The same script with cvc5. Expected: **Satisfiable**, possibly another model.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Cvc5,
  "(set-logic QF_LIA)\n(declare-const x Int)\n(declare-const y Int)\n(assert (> x 2))\n(assert (= (+ x y) 10))\n(check-sat)\n(get-model)\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

Several `check-sat` commands give a table of results and no single verdict.
Expected: `sat`, `unsat`, `sat`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ6MyIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoic210bGliIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInNvdXJjZSI6IihkZWNsYXJlLWNvbnN0IHAgQm9vbClcbihjaGVjay1zYXQpXG4ocHVzaCAxKVxuKGFzc2VydCAoYW5kIHAgKG5vdCBwKSkpXG4oY2hlY2stc2F0KVxuKHBvcCAxKVxuKGNoZWNrLXNhdClcbiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Z3,
  "(declare-const p Bool)\n(check-sat)\n(push 1)\n(assert (and p (not p)))\n(check-sat)\n(pop 1)\n(check-sat)\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

Expected: **Timeout** after two seconds.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ6MyIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoic210bGliIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoyfSwic291cmNlIjoiKHNldC1sb2dpYyBOSUEpXG4oZGVjbGFyZS1jb25zdCB4IEludClcbihkZWNsYXJlLWNvbnN0IHkgSW50KVxuKGRlY2xhcmUtY29uc3QgeiBJbnQpXG4oYXNzZXJ0IChhbmQgKD4geCAwKSAoPiB5IDApICg-IHogMCkpKVxuKGFzc2VydCAoPSAoKyAoKiB4IHggeCkgKCogeSB5IHkpKSAoKiB6IHogeikpKVxuKGNoZWNrLXNhdClcbiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Z3,
  "(set-logic NIA)\n(declare-const x Int)\n(declare-const y Int)\n(declare-const z Int)\n(assert (and (> x 0) (> y 0) (> z 0)))\n(assert (= (+ (* x x x) (* y y y)) (* z z z)))\n(check-sat)\n",
  time_limit: 2
)
```

## Linting

Expected: under the editor, `declare-const` lacks its sort and `simplify` is not an
SMT-LIB 2.6 command (warning); evaluating raises `Loge.Error`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ6MyIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoic210bGliIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInNvdXJjZSI6IihkZWNsYXJlLWNvbnN0IHgpXG4oc2ltcGxpZnkgKCsgMSAyKSlcbihjaGVjay1zYXQpXG4iLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Z3, "(declare-const x)\n(simplify (+ 1 2))\n(check-sat)\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

A solver error appears in the Result tab. Expected: `unknown constant y` on line 2.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ6MyIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoic210bGliIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInNvdXJjZSI6IihkZWNsYXJlLWNvbnN0IHggSW50KVxuKGFzc2VydCAoPiB5IDEpKVxuKGNoZWNrLXNhdClcbiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Z3, "(declare-const x Int)\n(assert (> y 1))\n(check-sat)\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

